      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm putting together the briefing for the quarterly audit next week. Can you give me a high-level summary of our current defensive integrity? Specifically, are there any gaps or known issues with our scanning or monitoring tools that we need to address before the auditors get here? I need to know if we're solid.",
